@startuml FoodRescue_Recipient_Verification

title FoodRescue — Recipient Verification Activity

start

:Recipient submits registration;
:Create recipient account;
:Set verification status to Pending;
:Notify administrator;

:Administrator reviews recipient information;

if (Information valid?) then (Yes)

    :Approve recipient registration;
    :Set verification status to Approved;
    :Enable eligible recipient functionality;
    :Notify recipient;

else (No)

    :Reject recipient registration;
    :Set verification status to Rejected;
    :Notify recipient;

endif

stop

@enduml